---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Quarlon Software - Barbershop Showcase</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #09090b;
      --text: #fafafa;
      --muted: #a1a1aa;
      --border: #27272a;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      max-width: 800px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #a1a1aa);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .header p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #18181b;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: #52525b;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .card-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .card-content {
      padding: 24px;
      flex-grow: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .card-desc {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      align-self: flex-start;
    }
    
    /* Specific Theme Colors */
    .theme-bourbon .card-title { color: #df9452; }
    .theme-bourbon .badge { background: rgba(223, 148, 82, 0.1); color: #df9452; border: 1px solid rgba(223, 148, 82, 0.3); }
    
    .theme-neon .card-title { color: #00f3ff; }
    .theme-neon .badge { background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.1); color: #00f3ff; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.3); }
    
    .theme-minimal .card-title { color: #ffffff; }
    .theme-minimal .badge { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); }

    .btn-view {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #27272a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .card:hover .btn-view {
      background: #3f3f46;
    }
    
    .watermark {
      margin-top: 60px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .grid-3 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .grid-3 {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
  }
  .card-img {
    height: 200px;
  }
}
</style>

</head>
<body>
  
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Quarlon Software</h1>
    <p>Catálogo de Plantillas Web Premium para Barberías y Salones.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <!-- BOURBON -->
    <a href="/bourbon" class="card theme-bourbon">
      <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" alt="Bourbon Theme" class="card-img" />
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="badge">Classic Premium</span>
        <h2 class="card-title">Bourbon &amp; Blade</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">Estética clásica de los años 20. Tonos cálidos, madera, cuero y elegancia atemporal. Ideal para barberías tradicionales de alto standing.</p>
        <span class="btn-view">Ver Plantilla</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- NEON -->
    <a href="/neon" class="card theme-neon">
      <img src="/assets/hero_neon.jpg" alt="Neon Theme" class="card-img" />
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="badge">Vintage Classic</span>
        <h2 class="card-title">Vintage Cuts</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">El auténtico estilo de las barberías de toda la vida. Diseño limpio, colores emblemáticos (rojo, blanco y azul) y la máxima precisión en cada corte a navaja.</p>
        <span class="btn-view">Ver Plantilla</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- MINIMAL -->
    <a href="/minimal" class="card theme-minimal">
      <img src="/assets/hero_minimal.jpg" alt="Minimal Theme" class="card-img" />
      <div class="card-content">
        <span class="badge">Warm Japandi</span>
        <h2 class="card-title">Pure Studio</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">Un oasis de bienestar estilo Japandi. Tonos arena cálidos, maderas naturales y cosmética botánica. Diseñado para transmitir la máxima relajación y lujo silencioso.</p>
        <span class="btn-view">Ver Plantilla</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="watermark">
    &copy; 2026 Quarlon Software - Portfolio Showcase
  </div>

</body>
</html>
